            <note corresp="#d29-f1" n="43" type="source" xml:id="d29-f1-content">
                <p>In English and French; French text not printed. Ratification advised by the
                    Senate, Mar. 27, 1922; ratified by the President, June 9, 1923; ratifications
                    deposited with the Government of the United States, Aug. 17, 1923; proclaimed,
                    Aug. 21, 1923.</p>
